[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13742.229, "timestamp": "03:49:02", "text": "兄弟就是文化，兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13748.87, "timestamp": "03:49:08", "text": "什么是文化？ Kaiishi 胸罩文化。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13751.83, "timestamp": "03:49:11", "text": "你是在谈论内衣文化吗？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13754.55, "timestamp": "03:49:14", "text": "搞兄弟文化的家伙是喵猫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13756.71, "timestamp": "03:49:16", "text": "最大限度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13759.75, "timestamp": "03:49:19", "text": "是他把这种兄弟文化带了过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13763.11, "timestamp": "03:49:23", "text": "在这个空间里。实际上，我就是这样做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13767.269, "timestamp": "03:49:27", "text": "终于知道了“bro”是什么意思。每次呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13771.51, "timestamp": "03:49:31", "text": "他说话的时候就直接说“兄弟”。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13773.91, "timestamp": "03:49:33", "text": "“嗯？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13780.95, "timestamp": "03:49:40", "text": "而且，这还算是一种独特的体验。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13783.59, "timestamp": "03:49:43", "text": "尽管。大家都叫他“兄弟”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13786.309, "timestamp": "03:49:46", "text": "团伙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13790.469, "timestamp": "03:49:50", "text": "我觉得他们之间没有兄弟情。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13793.03, "timestamp": "03:49:53", "text": "但是，你不觉得他兄弟很善良吗？"}]